{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "62186c7903d514aa82aa27f03b2029e061e2c85383c7f2d8d07fe59ac6f7a191", "ja": "ハッピーを集めて", "zh": "收集快乐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7167a0bb1b8592c684697d5c1539cb9d2612ab1b9e73dc3037f004dbd05e44fd", "ja": "『心のレッスン』第2回。翼の希望で遊び回\nる3人。クレープを食べ、ショッピングを楽\nしむ翼と未来を、さすがに注意する静香だっ\nたが、逆にふたりに諭される。やがて劇場に\n戻った3人の顔には、笑顔があった。", "zh": "《心的课程》第2回。应翼的要求，3人玩了个痛\n快。翼和未来吃着可丽饼，享受着购\n物，静香实在看不下去便提醒她们，却反倒被两人劝了一番。后来回到剧场的\n3人脸上，都带着笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "1c9f16794d23c165fe211098d778ce9137e9d4a24583e5acc014f80f1305da62", "ja": "―都内某所―", "zh": "——东京都内某处——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "627a34f36d50e8d1da427839304ae1f1528c0ee1c529609d17e3ead12141fba0", "ja": "ん～～♪\nやっぱりあのお店のクレープおいしい～！", "zh": "嗯～～♪\n果然还是那家店的可丽饼好吃～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "d8f69d06bde10150e46882e58880adabd3cb27f88d93b5da20c9c1f723fcfc45", "ja": "生クリームいっぱいで、しあわせ～♪\n静香ちゃん、どうして生クリーム追加しなかったの？", "zh": "鲜奶油满满的，好幸福～♪\n静香，你为什么不加鲜奶油呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "bd17e82c5de9b39c6d876181d764e2ed0a5614dd0989a63242990984a1e4c362", "ja": "追加するのが普通みたいに言わないの。\n食べ過ぎると、レッスンがきつくなるんだから。", "zh": "别说得好像加料是理所当然的。吃太多的话，训练会变得很辛苦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "c9526bdbb2c37a64acb9d70934c8701aaab16acd9943f1c930d8a1d01817dae2", "ja": "大丈夫だよ～溶けるから♪　あ、ねえ翼！　あっちの\nお店、女の子がいっぱい集まってるけど、何かあるの？", "zh": "没事的啦～会化掉的嘛♪　啊，翼你看！那边的\n店聚了好多女孩子，是有什么活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d346abc9fdfe3565b9fef6a6d39fc2f496378cd9a9f74e7ce4e769cef368a2ea", "ja": "あそこは、カワイイ系のブランドが集まってるショップ\nだよ。せっかくだから見に行こっか？", "zh": "那里是聚集了可爱风格品牌的店铺。难得来一趟，要不要去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "65b7f4589cd6704ea531e9891ca03cec3b07d15a0f17c840d62a60f9301d0119", "ja": "うん、せっかくだから行こう行こう！\nほら、静香ちゃんも、早く早く～！", "zh": "嗯，难得来一次，去看看去看看！\n快点，静香也快点快点～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "3b35fe4b644d383d7c70308c155942d964ffb18b164b2341235fa7860c5a8b46", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待って、ふたりとも！\nもう、こんな時ばっかり、行動が早いんだからっ！", "zh": "等、等一下，你们两个！\n真是的，偏偏这种时候行动特别快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "998b091eab7c102e4b2747b807396e0c2c2cae016be6e6c449c4a9cd0cf99ad6", "ja": "ねえ、翼……。\nこれは、運命の出会いだよ。", "zh": "呐，小翼……。\n这就是命运的邂逅哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7df6083092b7b7d3ad3649893a7c5ea028b49d605eee2bfce22ba8edc309f2c7", "ja": "未来もそう思う？\nじゃあ、やっぱり運命なのかも……。", "zh": "未来也这么觉得吗？\n那果然……也许真的是命中注定吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e87574e59a0ef34e8d91858d3d6a66dc207135d19f435abadce8d0d48520d361", "ja": "ううっ、袖がふわ～ってしててカワイイ～！\nどうしよう、買っちゃおうかな～？", "zh": "呜呜，袖子蓬蓬的，好可爱～！\n怎么办，要不要买下来呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c187c975828311ef55af4f6ef77499f30be1917129cb09387875d16285751169", "ja": "あっ。そっちのワンピースは静香ちゃんに似合いそう！\n肩が出てるから、なんか大人っぽいかも！", "zh": "啊，那边的连衣裙感觉很适合静香！\n因为露着肩膀，所以感觉有点成熟呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "ba1cad0e2d9b1f78ddb4a55e284a43637121740655002d2f8138699be8d42727", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　私にはまだ早い……ってちーがーう！\nどうして普通に買い物しに来た感じになってるのよ？", "zh": "是、是吗？对我来说还太早了……不对——！怎么感觉变成普通地来买东西了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c7e5ac1bf62b6a9e58cc37e036833abb7f968f0eed1c7178d9c6879349a44a3", "ja": "もう、静香ちゃんは真面目すぎー。\nお買い物も心のレッスンだと思うな～？", "zh": "真是的，静香你也太认真啦——\n我觉得逛街也是心灵的练习嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "ae87c6f62a876917cdcca72a4481d7fba80401e25aab125bc62e4fc6dcb7d49a", "ja": "とかいって、翼はただ、\nレッスンしたくないだけじゃないの？", "zh": "话虽这么说，翼其实只是单纯不想练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b503a85f0294b8c541afafdbc0b3f2ef8e4ee4d158c3cd4964eb69346385b7d", "ja": "そんなこと、ちょっとしかないもーん。\nそれに、新曲のためにもなると思うんだけどな～。", "zh": "才不是那样呢，也就一点点嘛——\n而且，我觉得这对新歌也会有帮助呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "493f8dd1c37735cdfae7cc69b7d9d5cb886469438765b8fdb98a7777e4d5e50a", "ja": "えっ、そうなんだ？\n私、普通に買い物しに来た感じになってた……。", "zh": "诶，是这样啊？我已经变成一副普通来买东西的样子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "7aa7e46f5ef7c944d49e37aaf22e6694f196e75f2f2118647ecd5a3c6427108a", "ja": "未来……！", "zh": "未来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50d6c503ea6aeee233de1ba202de2685ec50432c7dfd0dd29f1bd45fd30a4937", "ja": "それでいいと思うな～。だってあの曲、\nすっごくハッピーなんだもん。", "zh": "我觉得那样就好啦～。因为那首歌，\n真的特别快乐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "63844d2f9f8b85a889eb2250c092d58be67c3e75ec700ab41e61a9926878575c", "ja": "聞いてると、どんどん元気になれるっていうか。だから\nあの曲を歌うわたし達も、ハッピーにならなきゃね♪", "zh": "听着听着，就会越来越有精神，怎么说呢。所以，唱那首歌的我们也得变得开心才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e484a7093b12e844c23f6f51983ad978e10f890ff2dc8a413b177eb170f63f72", "ja": "いっぱい楽しいことして、ハッピーを集めるの。\nそれからみんなに、そのハッピーを届けるって感じ！", "zh": "去做超多开心的事情，把快乐都收集起来。\n然后再把这份快乐传递给大家，就是这种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "1302b92ecd314295fdc151b44a3c73368881d5ccb51f6bb73856963fca45ecaf", "ja": "おお～。今の翼、なんかアイドルって感じだったかも！\nよーし、私ももーっと遊ばなきゃ！", "zh": "哦～刚才的翼，感觉还真像个偶像呢！好——我也得再多玩一会儿才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "ed57c6e9417b4964e7e359a6cfaed6d0bf2706675d70d169efb6808873670e8d", "ja": "やっぱり遊ぶつもりじゃない。\nもう、心のレッスンとか都合のいい言い方して……。", "zh": "果然不是打算玩啊。真是的，还说什么“心灵训练”，找这种方便的说法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dd6ffea9e4b6089eb73a154a7bb4925e40e45487d8338bac7127cdfbf1c81b5b", "ja": "都合よくてもいいと思うな～。最近の静香ちゃん、\nずーっと怖い顔してたもん。よくないよ？", "zh": "就算是找个方便的借口，我觉得也没什么不好嘛～。静香最近一直都板着一张可怕的脸。这样可不好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "0c8bd10ffa5a15dc2012c96d5b3d89177d4310f0ccf29c0b442c3a890d05a9ee", "ja": "えっ……。\n私、そんなに……？", "zh": "诶……\n我有那么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d8bd889c525b71d10d15be04846b9d1198171db56c09b8f217e84ab65103c67", "ja": "静香ちゃん、ちゃんと遊びに行ったりしてる？\n最近どこにも行ってなかったりしない？", "zh": "静香，你平时有好好出去玩吗？最近是不是都没去什么地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "f8abfd46c0aa75190523fd66b6842002ea1f9128dee49dca26946779b4aa802a", "ja": "ち、ちゃんと行ってるわよ。その……カラオケとか。\nこの前なんか、95点超えたんだから。すごいでしょ？", "zh": "我、我当然有好好出去玩啊。那个……比如去唱卡拉OK之类的。\n前阵子我还唱到了超过95分呢。很厉害吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "4d61426bf329a4e29f586a93df559d2a87e52e1523d967bd30d28810f96d68d6", "ja": "わ、すごいすごーい！\nじゃあ、次はカラオケに決定ね！", "zh": "哇，好厉害好厉害～！\n那接下来就决定去卡拉OK啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "0068b454b1b07ac5613723fc099184aea17bafe595beefbc00caa83826b361f3", "ja": "ええっ！？　こ、これ以上はさすがにダメだと思う！\n劇場に戻ってレッスンの続きをしましょう？", "zh": "诶诶！？再、再继续下去真的不行了！\n我们回剧场继续上课吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a9d7622cbea1738d654f5937bfa1df9121ae72901d391fa5c709a9b1793499d6", "ja": "でも、カラオケはボイスレッスンにもなるよね？\n1時間だけでもいいから～。静香ちゃん、ダメ？", "zh": "不过，唱卡拉OK也能练习唱功吧？\n哪怕只唱1个小时也行嘛～静香，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "84919e9ea5765a3e46fbf2ce643df9a4f0bad346900f56d006e681ed848adbe9", "ja": "静香ちゃん、ダメ？", "zh": "静香，不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "b771df9dabe34339b4c64d986b1ac73bf522253b1226e3556b28f2290b418e8b", "ja": "……ううう、わかったわよ！\nでも本当の本当に、1時間だけね！", "zh": "……呜呜，我知道了啦！\n但真的说好了，只能有1个小时哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "318ff7f01f0c7eaa3b7725e9a62d70a1807e29324592e81ef474134400560193", "ja": "もう。変なとこばっかり、息ピッタリ……。\nはぁ。", "zh": "真是的。净是在奇怪的地方配合得天衣无缝……\n唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1035_null", "source_sha256": "7384f0d23bd8ff51bd8e292a2a41ef910e0e2e8a88fdf1559dc25f4d6a0cf915", "ja": "―2時間後―", "zh": "——2小时后——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "c3b40bb38ed01bc54bc1b0a3509c3df5c70034d4dbb6feb50ad23941b515cebc", "ja": "（未来達、なかなか帰ってこないな。息抜きの\nわりには、すごい時間がかかっているような……）", "zh": "（未来她们怎么还没回来啊。说是放松一下，花的时间也太久了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "b29058192e93c1a92eb5987f66babe5e72d50a3fa27b7eb73f779aa7342b10d6", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さーん！\n春日未来、ただいま帰りましたーっ！", "zh": "辛苦啦，{$P$}先生！\n春日未来回来啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "03cf5c1424f58f7e2f34c8e9f023f5ad71766644cbe3b0d420cd7a7c8bb677ff", "ja": "っと、おかえり。はは、凄い元気じゃないか。\nどうやら、いい息抜きができたみたいだな！", "zh": "哦，欢迎回来。哈哈，看来你精神头很足嘛。\n看样子，这次放松得很不错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "20de91c71ac3b0b97bc5270ef50cb577017baf4f9765e4e7093ce8b3c609b9db", "ja": "はーい、楽しかったでーす♪\n静香ちゃんは、ボイスレッスンもいっぱいしたよね？", "zh": "好——玩得很开心♪  \n静香也做了很多发声练习，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "6dfde21bfb93282781b48ac7801cd0317cdc99ce846646c347bf3336fe28c596", "ja": "ええ、発声練習はバッチリです。今日は調子もいい\nみたいですから、遅れた分もすぐ取り戻して見せます！", "zh": "嗯，发声练习也完全没问题。今天状态好像也很好，我一定会马上把落下的进度补回来给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0166_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "04cbeb248bcc61ac211828190584dcd1fb4316fa02981d06a255e247d3e8cc3a", "ja": "（静香もみんなも、すっかり表情が明るくなった。\n「心のレッスン」は大成功したみたいだな！）", "zh": "（静香和大家的表情都彻底明朗起来了。看来这次“心灵课程”大获成功啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
